\label{sec:star-shaped-level-sets}

Let $V\Subset W$ be open sets star-shaped with respect to $0$, set
$U=W\setminus\overline V$, $\Gamma_0=\partial W$, and $\Gamma_1=\partial V$, and let $u$ solve
\[
\begin{cases}
-\Delta u=0 & \text{in }U,\\
u=1 & \text{on }\Gamma_1,\\
u=0 & \text{on }\Gamma_0.
\end{cases}
\tag{1}
\]
Then $0<u<1$ in $U$.

